---

<BaseLayout title="Head Acupressure Points" description="Browse acupressure points on the head. Find detailed guides for GV20, GB20, Yintang, and more." breadcrumbs={[{ label: "Home", href: "/" }, { label: "Body Atlas", href: "/atlas/" }, { label: "Head", href: "/body/head-acupressure-points/" }]}>
