bold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">GV24.5 (Shangxing)</h3><span class="text-xs text-stone-400 dark:text-stone-500">·</span><span class="text-xs text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">Upper Star</span></div><div class="text-yellow-500 text-xs mt-0.5">★★★☆☆</div><p class="text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 mt-0.5">Frontal headaches, sinus congestion</p></div><span class="text-sm text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity shrink-0">Learn More →</span></a></div><div class="text-center mt-10"><a href="/atlas/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-stone-500 hover:text-emerald-600 dark:text-stone-400 dark:hover:text-emerald-400">← Back to Body Atlas</a></div></div>
